{"seq":86,"slug":"frontend-monorepo-tooling","title":"前端 Monorepo 工具链","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"前端-monorepo-工具链\">前端 Monorepo 工具链</h1><h2 id=\"这个-hub-是什么\">这个 Hub 是什么</h2><p>本 Hub 聚焦于<strong>前端 Monorepo 工具链</strong>的系统性知识：从 Monorepo 与 Polyrepo 的架构决策，到主流包管理器 Workspaces 对比，再到 Turborepo 与 Nx 两大构建编排工具的工程实践，最终涵盖大规模 Monorepo 的 CI 优化、代码所有权治理与迁移策略。</p>\n<p>面向已有前端工程经验、希望搭建或优化团队级 Monorepo 工程体系的中级开发者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖范围\">覆盖范围</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心主题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 基础架构</td>\n<td>Monorepo vs Polyrepo 决策框架、包管理器 Workspaces、依赖图管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 构建编排</td>\n<td>Turborepo 工程实践、Nx 工作空间、任务缓存与远程缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 代码质量</td>\n<td>共享配置与约定、受影响分析与精准测试、版本管理与发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 规模化</td>\n<td>CI 优化策略、代码所有权与边界、迁移策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻-hub-的边界\">与相邻 Hub 的边界</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前端打包工具内核</strong>（frontend-bundler-internals）：聚焦于单个 bundler（Webpack/Vite/Rollup）的内部机制；本 Hub 聚焦于多包协同的构建编排层，而非 bundler 本身的实现。</li>\n<li><strong>前端微前端</strong>（frontend-micro-frontends）：微前端侧重运行时的应用组合与隔离；Monorepo 工具链侧重开发时的代码组织与构建效率，两者可以并存但关注点不同。</li>\n<li><strong>设计系统</strong>（design-systems）：设计系统是 Monorepo 中常见的共享 package；本 Hub 讲解如何把设计系统作为内部 package 管理，而非设计系统本身的内容结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Monorepo 实践中常见的 npm/yarn/pnpm workspaces 选型问题，可结合本 Hub 第 1 章基础架构阅读官方文档进行深化。</li>\n<li>大规模 CI 优化与代码边界治理是本 Hub 第 4 章的重点，对于团队规模超过 10 人的工程体系尤为关键。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monorepo-architecture-patterns","title":"Monorepo 架构模式：决策框架与设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/foundations/monorepo-architecture-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"package-manager-workspaces","title":"包管理器 Workspaces：pnpm/npm/yarn 对比与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/foundations/package-manager-workspaces"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-graph-management","title":"依赖图管理：内部包依赖解析与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/foundations/dependency-graph-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-orchestration","title":"构建编排","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/build-orchestration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"turborepo-engineering","title":"Turborepo 工程实践：pipeline、hash 缓存与 remote cache","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/build-orchestration/turborepo-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nx-workspace","title":"Nx 工作空间：项目图、受影响分析与 generators","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/build-orchestration/nx-workspace"},{"seq":3,"slug":"task-caching-remote","title":"任务缓存与远程缓存：本地缓存、Vercel Remote Cache 与 Nx Cloud","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/build-orchestration/task-caching-remote"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"code-quality","title":"代码质量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-config-conventions","title":"共享配置与约定：ESLint/TSConfig/Prettier 跨包统一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/shared-config-conventions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"affected-testing","title":"受影响分析与精准测试：git diff → task graph → selective run","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/affected-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"versioning-publishing","title":"版本管理与发布：Changesets、Lerna 与 semantic-release","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/versioning-publishing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"scaling","title":"规模化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-optimization-monorepo","title":"CI 优化策略：分片、并行与增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/ci-optimization-monorepo"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-ownership-boundaries","title":"代码所有权与边界：CODEOWNERS 与模块边界约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/code-ownership-boundaries"},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-strategies","title":"迁移策略：Polyrepo 到 Monorepo 的完整方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/migration-strategies"}]}]}